# No Sparkles / glitter icons — forbidden

Lucide **`Sparkles`** (and glitter/sparkle-style icons) must **not** appear in product UI.

## Do not use

- `Sparkles` from `lucide-react` on buttons, nav, empty states, or section headers
- Decorative glitter / four-point star “AI magic” icons next to Generate, Humanize, Enhance, or similar actions

## Use instead

| Action | Prefer |
|---|---|
| Generate / regenerate | `RefreshCw`, `FileText`, or text-only |
| Humanize / rewrite | `PenLine`, `Pencil`, or text-only |
| Enhance / improve | `TrendingUp`, `CheckCircle2`, or text-only |
| Generic accent | Existing brand icons already in the screen — never sparkles |

Marketing pages that already use Sparkles should be migrated when touched; new product UI must not introduce them.

**Enforced in:** `docs/memory.md`, `.agents/skills/goals-ac-conventions/SKILL.md`.
